00:04:46.849 --> 00:04:51.689
attend a public hearing on December 3rd, and a closed-door briefing by three House committees

00:04:51.689 --> 00:04:57.909
is expected on December 1st. Republican representative Pat Harrigan called reinstating Huang as chief

00:04:57.909 --> 00:05:01.309
executive at this moment inappropriate, a dangerous signal.

00:05:02.029 --> 00:05:07.909
Zao Bao flags its English text as an AI translation and says the original Chinese stays authoritative.

00:05:08.827 --> 00:05:15.067
Deputy Comptroller Noah Betz, KBTX reports, signed a recommendation on November 24th,

00:05:15.127 --> 00:05:21.247
