00:05:21.447 --> 00:05:26.367
and innovation program on a Brazos County logic plant at two nanometers or better.

00:05:26.367 --> 00:05:30.267
The Comptroller's report estimates a $354 million

00:05:30.267 --> 00:05:33.067
