00:05:33.467 --> 00:05:36.947
with about $405 million in school operating taxes

00:05:36.947 --> 00:05:38.567
still generated in that span.

00:05:39.247 --> 00:05:40.507
Those amounts are projections,

00:05:40.907 --> 00:05:43.907
