Singapore Business Review reports Singapore and the United States are working on a mechanism

00:06:30.787 --> 00:06:36.967
for chip export control. Digitimes reports Congress is advancing three AI chip export bills

00:06:36.967 --> 00:06:43.327
as NVIDIA's chief executive returns. Semiconductor Engineering's November 25th paper roundup points

00:06:43.327 --> 00:06:49.067
to hybrid-bonded 3D-NAND analog in memory compute, defect-aware chiplet matching,

00:06:49.687 --> 00:06:56.487
HBM latency reduction for GPU systems, backside clock meshes, post-quantum hardware verification,

00:06:57.087 --> 00:07:02.587
chemical mechanical polishing virtual metrology, and e-beam stitching losses in silicon on

00:07:02.587 --> 00:07:08.213
insulator waveguides. A published weight file can still name the machine that first filled it.

00:07:08.613 --> 00:07:13.013
Training does not open on an empty tensor. A library writes a starting pattern,

00:07:13.013 --> 00:07:18.373
and that pattern depends on how the initialization kernel was launched, including how many streaming

00:07:18.373 --> 00:07:22.753
multi-processors took part and how the random streams were mapped across them.

00:07:23.393 --> 00:07:29.033
Israel Defense, on a forensic study by Unemployment Labs, says researchers rebuilt those initial

00:07:29.033 --> 00:07:34.073
values from public model weights and then hunted the hardware and initialization setups that

00:07:34.073 --> 00:07:39.973
reproduced the numbers exactly. The trace is in the weights, not in a leak. The split they publish

00:07:39.973 --> 00:07:48.193
is the core count. In this method a Blackwell B200 or B300 Signature is 148 streaming multi-processors,

00:07:48.493 --> 00:07:57.193
and a GB200 or GB300 Signature is 152. Six models out since April 2026, from DeepSeek,

00:07:57.413 --> 00:08:03.633
Moonshot AI, Minimax, and Ant Group, carry patterns consistent with Blackwell, while earlier models

00:08:03.633 --> 00:08:05.853
from those same firms line up with Hopper.

00:08:06.533 --> 00:08:11.333
Deepseek V4 Flash and Mini Max M3 match the 148 core pattern.

00:08:11.933 --> 00:08:20.653
Deepseek V4 Pro, Kimi K3, Kimi K3.1 Pro, and Ling 3.1 Flash match the 152 core pattern.

00:08:21.073 --> 00:08:27.093
For Deepseek V4 Flash and Kimi K3, the match was checked on physical blackwall chips, not

00:08:27.093 --> 00:08:27.893
only in a search.

00:08:28.493 --> 00:08:34.033
Deepseek V3, KimiK 2.5, and Ling 3.0 flash day on the hopper side.

00:08:34.653 --> 00:08:37.153
KimiK 2.7 code sits between them.

00:08:37.713 --> 00:08:42.073
Hopper error weights plus a minor slice consistent with B200 or B300.

00:08:42.713 --> 00:08:45.173
The control set is what makes the count usable.

00:08:45.873 --> 00:08:50.933
The same test was run on 24 models whose developers had already named the hardware, and

00:08:50.933 --> 00:08:56.873
And everyone matched, including Nvidia's Nemotron 3 Ultra at that same 152 core signature.

00:08:57.493 --> 00:09:01.393
Israel Defense says the correlation sit far above a chance explanation.

00:09:02.013 --> 00:09:06.293
The only other set up the researchers found that could mimic the pattern is custom-configured

00:09:06.293 --> 00:09:07.193
AMD hardware.

00:09:07.693 --> 00:09:09.733
It's self-restricted for export to China.

00:09:10.333 --> 00:09:15.073
That alternative was ruled out for deep-seek V4 Flash and called highly improbable for

00:09:15.073 --> 00:09:15.773
the other five.

00:09:15.773 --> 00:09:22.553
The recent models from Alibaba, Jipu, Tencent, Jaume, and Stepfun still indicated hopper

00:09:22.553 --> 00:09:29.213
and Maytwan's Longcat 2.0, which the company said was trained on an AI-A6 super pod, showed

00:09:29.213 --> 00:09:30.513
no Nvidia fingerprint.

00:09:31.133 --> 00:09:33.573
The fingerprint names how the weights were generated.

00:09:34.033 --> 00:09:38.693
It supports the idea that Blackwell also ran the training, and it does not prove that.

00:09:39.093 --> 00:09:44.213
It does not say where the chip sat, how access was obtained, or whether a rule was broken.

00:09:44.213 --> 00:09:44.773
treatment.

00:09:44.773 --> 00:09:49.853
Treating a reproduced initialization, checked on silicon for two models and against 24

00:09:49.853 --> 00:09:54.833
disclosed cases, as evidence of blackwell use stops being the right instrument when the

00:09:54.833 --> 00:09:59.813
question is a place, a shipment, or a violation, or when a later training stack could have

00:09:59.813 --> 00:10:01.793
left the initialization machine behind.

00:10:02.373 --> 00:10:09.213
At that point, the 148 versus 152 split still describes the first fill, and it no longer

00:10:09.213 --> 00:10:10.633
identifies the training run.

